        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: David Thewlis\n- Works: James and the Giant Peach, The Miracle Maker, Anomalisa, Fargo\n- Organizations: FX\n- Concepts: voice acting, anthology television format\n\nFacts:\n- David Thewlis did voice work in the film \"James and the Giant Peach\" in 1996.\n- David Thewlis did voice work in the film \"The Miracle Maker\" in 2000.\n- Fargo premiered on FX on April 15, 2014.\n- Fargo uses an anthology format in which each season is set in a different era and tells a different story with mostly new characters and cast, with minor overlap.\n- David Thewlis did voice work in the film \"Anomalisa\" in 2015.",
